{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y 的 S09「甚至愿意再受那些气」比 X 更替人物下结论，把原本复杂的犹疑推向了较明确的极端解释。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"平\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 用重点加亮让观众更快抓住每段话的核心，又把感受拆成随音乐进程出现的小段，不必在短时间内同时筛选大量词语，扫读和听觉体验更容易兼顾。两版的人物动机和故事主线其实相当完整，但 Y 的感受描述更具体，情绪转折与音乐变化也结合得更紧，尤其能让人感到同一种想念如何从温暖逐渐转为失落、犹疑，最后变成带着遗憾继续生活的力量。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8658a6a8-e7c5-4941-967f-d600e526b1e1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T010521826019Z", "elapsed_seconds": 68.813, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:06:30.657871+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a9bf204d0b1becca00ff97ea16d7ea4d32687541a88602ea09b09bf166f4d770", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "